  "body": "Discover effortless modern living in these brand-new brick/weatherboard townhouses. Brought to you by the reputable CETA Homes, Kamata Terrace is nestled within the serene and growing Ara Hills community in Orewa. Perfectly suited for first-home buyers, small families, or savvy investors, this low-maintenance, turn-key home blends contemporary style with everyday practicality, surrounded by nature yet conveniently close to urban amenities.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• 2/3 bedrooms available\r\n• Durable brick & weatherboard exterior\r\n• 1/2 car parks - (Garage Option available) \r\n• 10% Deposit\r\n• 77sqm to 132sqm Floor Area depending on the unit\r\n• Choice of interior colour Options\r\n• Fisher & Paykel Appliances\r\n• Settlement estimated for February 2027 - Construction well underway\r\n• Built by CETA Homes and back by a Halo 10-Year Guarantee \r\nPrime Location: Set in the peaceful Ara Hills development, this home enjoys a beautiful backdrop of native bush, open green spaces, and walking trails right on your doorstep. Just minutes from Orewa's vibrant town centre, quality schools, shops, cafes, and the iconic beach, with a straightforward commute of around 30 minutes to Auckland CBD via the nearby motorway.\r\n\r\nA perfect blend of quality craftsmanship, unbeatable location, and exceptional value – this is modern comfort in a community designed for connection and balance.\r\n \r\nCall Kaid on 021 285 1884 or kaid.maycock@bayleys.co.nz for all the information.",
